  "label": "Yoda is mapped as the speaker of the misogynistic parody line",
  "description": "The text 'hmmm minyoda i am beat women i must' is overlaid on the Yoda figurine, creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity (Yoda_figurine) is projected as the entity performing or uttering the textual message. This mapping is central to the meme's intent, as it uses Yoda's recognizable persona to deliver the offensive content, thereby creating a jarring contrast between the character's peaceful wisdom and the crude, misogynistic statement. The mapping is established through spatial adjacency and contextual juxtaposition, where the text is directly associated with the visual entity.",
